		<p>
			My observations from your pictures:<br>
			1) It's too close for this kind of measuring.<br>
			2) Trying to aim under yourself makes room for mistakes. Because when yo=
u reach bottom, the projection will stop. But your mouse can be still movin=
g.&nbsp;<br>
