e=3D"Monitor Distance Vertical"><abbr title=3D"Monitor Distance Vertical">M=
DV</abbr></abbr>.&nbsp;And as I see it, you're all like hey it's <abbr titl=
e=3D"Monitor Distance Vertical"><abbr title=3D"Monitor Distance Vertical">M=
DV</abbr></abbr> around 68 % end of story... But if i will want to find sma=
llest deviation in range of 0-40%. It will be like this:
