			1) If we have set mouse to 400 DPI. It means 1inch/400 DPI =3D&nbsp;0,00=
25 inch is minimum mouse distance that will create a move in Desktop/Game. =
I assume here that the mouse is able to detect minimal movement by a differ=
ence of one dot. And this mouse distance is equal 0,01069 inch at monitor s=
creen. Which is equal to&nbsp;0,09259 % <abbr title=3D"Monitor Distance Ver=
tical"><abbr title=3D"Monitor Distance Vertical">MDV</abbr></abbr> (in my c=
ase). What's the point of setting 0% MM when you will never reach that valu=
