<p>
	The "distance" in <abbr title=3D"Monitor Distance Vertical">MDV</abbr> 0% =
is infinitesimally small, once you move 1 pixel you are basically off. That=
's why I usually refer to it as tracking speed, because what it does is kee=
p the rate at which you move the mouse consistent with the rate that the ta=
rget on the monitor moves at any FOV.
</p>

